      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It may be off topic, but I think the root problem is not being able to tag Canny posts of a similar kind. I would like to tag the above post as “OpenBeta”, “UI2.0”.\nI think it's okay for someone other than the contributor to add the tag.\nオフトピックかもしれませんが、似た種類のCanny投稿をタグ付け出来ない事が、根本の問題ではないでしょうか。私は、上の投稿にOpenBeta, UI2.0とタグを付けたい。\nタグを追加するのは投稿者以外の人でもいいと思います。",
      "viewerReactions": null,
